00:24:29.726 --> 00:24:34.948
Salem Halloween Cookies.

00:24:35.008 --> 00:24:40.452
It's fun to organize a Halloween party in your home It's easy too.

00:24:40.512 --> 00:24:43.754
First, find a big room you can use.

00:24:43.814 --> 00:24:47.064
Second, make some scary decorations.

00:24:47.125 --> 00:24:50.205
Third, prepare some Halloween food.

00:24:50.265 --> 00:24:57.698
Popcorn, apples, sweets, pumpkin pies, and special Halloween cookies.

00:24:57.758 --> 00:25:01.199
Make Salem Halloween cookies for your party.

00:25:01.259 --> 00:25:04.230
It's easy, just follow the recipe.

00:25:04.290 --> 00:25:10.160
Ingredients Three-quarters of a cup of chopped nuts.

00:25:10.221 --> 00:25:12.822
One cup softened butter.

00:25:12.882 --> 00:25:15.584
Half a cup of powdered sugar.

00:25:15.644 --> 00:25:17.666
Half a cup flour.

00:25:17.726 --> 00:25:20.598
One teaspoon vanilla extract.

00:25:20.658 --> 00:25:23.490
Quarter of a teaspoon salt.

00:25:23.550 --> 00:25:24.721
Powdered sugar.

00:25:24.741 --> 00:25:27.943
You tensile to use.

00:25:28.003 --> 00:25:29.534
A big bowl.

00:25:29.594 --> 00:25:31.276
A wooden spoon.

00:25:31.336 --> 00:25:32.766
A teaspoon.

00:25:32.827 --> 00:25:35.138
A nonstick cookie sheet.

00:25:35.198 --> 00:25:36.488
Now.

00:25:36.548 --> 00:25:38.507
Chop the nuts.

00:25:38.567 --> 00:25:44.230
Mix together nuts, butter, sugar, and vanilla in the bowl.

00:25:44.290 --> 00:25:47.522
Slowly add flour and salt.

00:25:47.582 --> 00:25:51.424
Put the bowl in the refrigerator for one hour.

00:25:51.484 --> 00:25:58.128
Then make little balls, about two and a half centimeters in diameter.

00:25:58.188 --> 00:26:02.500
Roll each ball in powdered sugar three times.

00:26:02.560 --> 00:26:05.235
Put the balls on a cookie sheet.

00:26:05.295 --> 00:26:11.421
Bake in the oven, 175 degrees Celsius for 30 minutes.

00:26:11.481 --> 00:26:16.004
Happy Halloween.

00:26:16.064 --> 00:26:26.508
