Susan is a ghost.

00:30:49.542 --> 00:30:58.096
When they see Kelly's costume, they laugh and say, good evening Mrs. Abigail Ross.

00:30:58.156 --> 00:31:02.720
They cover the old table with a paper tablecloth.

00:31:02.780 --> 00:31:06.322
Then they put the food and drinks on the table.

00:31:06.382 --> 00:31:13.438
They light the candles because there is no electricity.

00:31:13.498 --> 00:31:19.060
Nick turns on his portable radio.

00:31:19.120 --> 00:31:22.202
Megan goes to the dark bedroom.

00:31:22.262 --> 00:31:26.634
She opens the door and looks inside.

00:31:26.694 --> 00:31:32.427
The black dress and black boots are not there.

00:31:32.487 --> 00:31:36.850
She is afraid that she says nothing to her friends.

00:31:36.910 --> 00:31:39.251
Soon their friends arrive.

00:31:39.311 --> 00:31:43.122
They all have scary costumes and masks.

00:31:43.183 --> 00:31:45.904
Is this a haunted house?

00:31:45.964 --> 00:31:47.915
It's very spooky.

00:31:47.975 --> 00:31:49.047
They say.

00:31:49.107 --> 00:31:51.200
No one answers.

00:31:51.260 --> 00:31:53.962
Some boys and girls dance.

00:31:54.022 --> 00:31:56.784
Others eat, talk, and laugh.

00:31:56.844 --> 00:31:58.915
Several hours pass.

00:31:58.975 --> 00:32:01.186
Everyone is happy.

00:32:01.246 --> 00:32:03.348
It's great, party.

00:32:03.408 --> 00:32:05.940
They say.

00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:09.973
It's time for the treasure hunt.

00:32:10.034 --> 00:32:13.396
Says Bill, you all have different maps.

00:32:13.456 --> 00:32:15.458
Let's start.

00:32:15.518 --> 00:32:18.806
Everyone starts in a different room.

00:32:18.866 --> 00:32:20.984
Some start in the kitchen.

00:32:21.044 --> 00:32:23.836
Others start in the bedrooms.

00:32:23.896 --> 00:32:28.991
Kelly takes her torch and goes downstairs to the basement.

00:32:29.052 --> 00:32:32.895
She looks inside a big barrel.

00:32:32.955 --> 00:32:39.030
It is very dark and Kelly is in the basement alone.

00:32:39.090 --> 00:32:44.410
Suddenly there is a sweet smell of roses.

00:32:44.470 --> 00:32:48.241
She turns on her torch and she is terrified.

00:32:48.301 --> 00:32:52.592
The old lady from the museum is standing by the barrel.

00:32:52.652 --> 00:32:55.252
You are not Abigail Cross.

00:32:55.312 --> 00:32:57.612
I am Abigail Cross.

00:32:57.673 --> 00:33:01.353
Tonight is Halloween and you are in my house.

00:33:01.413 --> 00:33:05.734
On this night we spirits look for young bodies.

00:33:05.794 --> 00:33:09.925
When we find a young body we can live again.

00:33:09.985 --> 00:33:14.007
At midnight, my spirit enters your body.

00:33:14.067 --> 00:33:17.870
You must die so that I can live.

00:33:17.930 --> 00:33:21.211
Kelly's heart is beating fast.

00:33:21.271 --> 00:33:23.782
Her legs can't move.

00:33:23.842 --> 00:33:25.834
She has no voice.

00:33:25.894 --> 00:33:31.316
Abigail Cross touches Kelly with her comb.

00:33:31.376 --> 00:33:34.658
She takes off Kelly's mask and wig.

00:33:34.718 --> 00:33:39.182
Your bed is in the barrel, your tire.

00:33:39.242 --> 00:33:42.576
You must sleep forever.

00:33:42.636 --> 00:33:44.688
Kelly obeys.

00:33:44.748 --> 00:33:48.100
She goes to sleep inside the barrel.

00:33:48.160 --> 00:33:52.684
Abigail puts on Kelly's mask and wig.

00:33:52.744 --> 00:33:58.860
She goes upstairs to the party.

00:33:58.920 --> 00:34:07.153
At half past 11, Nick says, It's almost midnight.

00:34:07.213 --> 00:34:09.766
Let's sit down and take off our masks.

00:34:09.826 --> 00:34:13.198
We want to see the person behind the mask.

00:34:13.258 --> 00:34:16.941
Nick asks, who is the alien?

00:34:17.001 --> 00:34:19.453
The alien takes off her mask.

00:34:19.513 --> 00:34:21.034
It's Megan.

00:34:21.094 --> 00:34:22.626
Everyone laughs.

00:34:22.686 --> 00:34:24.817
And who is the ghost?

00:34:24.878 --> 00:34:27.610
It's Susan.

00:34:27.670 --> 00:34:30.132
Who is the old lady?

00:34:30.192 --> 00:34:31.602
Asks Bill.

00:34:31.662 --> 00:34:34.574
The old lady takes off her mask.

00:34:34.634 --> 00:34:37.063
Everyone screams!

00:34:37.123 --> 00:34:40.150
It's Abigail Cross's ghost.

00:34:40.210 --> 00:34:43.392
Her face is white and her eyes are red.

00:34:43.452 --> 00:34:46.434
She has a red mark around her neck.

00:34:46.494 --> 00:34:50.416
She laughs and her teeth are black.

00:34:50.476 --> 00:34:52.317
Everyone is terrified.

00:34:52.377 --> 00:34:56.039
Bill looks at her and says, that's Kelly's costume.

00:34:56.099 --> 00:34:57.489
Where is Kelly?

00:34:57.550 --> 00:34:59.250
I am Kelly.

00:34:59.310 --> 00:35:03.123
At midnight, my spirit enters her body.

00:35:03.183 --> 00:35:05.496
Remember, I am a witch.

00:35:05.556 --> 00:35:08.050
Everyone wants to run away.

00:35:08.110 --> 00:35:11.792
They go to the door, but they cannot open it.

00:35:11.853 --> 00:35:17.285
There are the horrible faces of the other ghosts outside the windows.

00:35:17.345 --> 00:35:20.407
The ghosts are looking inside.

00:35:20.467 --> 00:35:21.998
Who are these people?

00:35:22.058 --> 00:35:23.798
asks Bill.

00:35:23.858 --> 00:35:29.292
They are the witches of the hangings of 1692.

00:35:29.352 --> 00:35:32.484
Look at the red mark on my neck.

00:35:32.544 --> 00:35:35.596
This is the mark of the rope.

00:35:35.656 --> 00:35:40.159
Twenty witches for twenty young bodies.

00:35:40.219 --> 00:35:43.570
Now you are in my house.

00:35:43.630 --> 00:35:47.382
This is the house of horrors.

00:35:47.442 --> 00:35:51.043
No one leaves this house alive.

00:35:51.103 --> 00:35:55.144
At midnight our spirits enter your bodies.

00:35:55.204 --> 00:35:57.045
We want to live again.

00:35:57.105 --> 00:36:00.286
We want to bring evil to Salem.

00:36:00.346 --> 00:36:02.086
Says Abigail Cross.

00:36:02.146 --> 00:36:03.477
Where is Kelly?

00:36:03.537 --> 00:36:04.580
asks Bill.

00:36:04.640 --> 00:36:07.755
Look at the portrait on the wall.

00:36:07.816 --> 00:36:09.566
Laughs the witch.

00:36:09.627 --> 00:36:12.109
Everyone looks at the portrait.

00:36:12.169 --> 00:36:14.921
They see Kelly's face.

00:36:14.981 --> 00:36:20.545
Her lips are red, and there is a red mark around her neck.

00:36:20.606 --> 00:36:24.899
This is a party, not yours!

00:36:24.959 --> 00:36:29.485
Screams the witch.

00:36:29.545 --> 00:36:36.082
They meet at the old house.

00:36:36.142 --> 00:36:40.045
Everyone is wearing scary costumes.

00:36:40.106 --> 00:36:43.208
The boys light candles.

00:36:43.268 --> 00:36:46.800
Everyone is ready for the party.

00:36:46.860 --> 00:36:52.874
Megan goes to the bedroom, but she sees nobody there.

00:36:52.934 --> 00:36:56.167
Soon their friends arrive.

00:36:56.227 --> 00:36:58.228
The party starts.

00:36:58.288 --> 00:37:00.809
Everyone is happy.

00:37:00.869 --> 00:37:03.620
Then there is a treasure hunt.

00:37:03.680 --> 00:37:12.366
Kelly goes downstairs and looks inside a big barrel.

00:37:12.426 --> 00:37:25.175
Chapter 8 Fire Suddenly, the decorations on the wall start moving.

00:37:25.235 --> 00:37:28.317
The bats are flying around the room.

00:37:28.377 --> 00:37:31.624
They are making strange noises.

00:37:31.684 --> 00:37:33.271
Screams a girl!

00:37:33.311 --> 00:37:35.442
There's a bat in my hair!

00:37:35.502 --> 00:37:36.093
Oh!

00:37:36.153 --> 00:37:37.194
Screams a boy!

00:37:37.254 --> 00:37:39.306
This bat is a vampire!

00:37:39.366 --> 00:37:42.688
Slowly the ghosts enter the house.

00:37:42.748 --> 00:37:45.270
They penetrate the walls.

00:37:45.330 --> 00:37:48.012
They are really spooky.

00:37:48.072 --> 00:37:50.994
They move around their victims.

00:37:51.054 --> 00:37:56.678
Megan and Susan are terrified and say, They're waiting for midnight.

00:37:56.738 --> 00:37:59.580
Do you remember the 20 names on the floor?

00:37:59.640 --> 00:38:01.758
These are their ghosts!

00:38:01.818 --> 00:38:03.745
We must find Kelly.

00:38:03.805 --> 00:38:05.005
Says Megan.

00:38:05.066 --> 00:38:07.918
A candle on the table falls.

00:38:07.978 --> 00:38:11.940
The paper tablecloth is burning.

00:38:12.000 --> 00:38:14.122
Fire!

00:38:14.182 --> 00:38:15.723
We must get out of here.

00:38:15.783 --> 00:38:16.704
Says Bill.

00:38:16.764 --> 00:38:19.045
Oh no, it's a big fire.

00:38:19.105 --> 00:38:20.076
Says Susan.

00:38:20.136 --> 00:38:21.687
We can't open the door.

00:38:21.747 --> 00:38:22.578
Says Nick.

00:38:22.638 --> 00:38:24.128
It's five to midnight.

00:38:24.188 --> 00:38:26.810
At midnight the ghosts take our bodies.

00:38:26.870 --> 00:38:27.941
What can we do?

00:38:27.961 --> 00:38:29.942
I must find Kelly.

00:38:30.002 --> 00:38:31.081
Says Bill.

00:38:31.141 --> 00:38:34.880
He takes his torch and runs to the basement.

00:38:34.940 --> 00:38:37.132
He looks in all the barrels.

00:38:37.192 --> 00:38:39.903
Finally, he sees Kelly.

00:38:39.963 --> 00:38:41.444
She is sleeping.

00:38:41.504 --> 00:38:42.474
Kelly!

00:38:42.534 --> 00:38:43.244
Kelly!

