00:39:42.508 --> 00:39:44.420
Quick, let's go!

00:39:44.480 --> 00:39:46.992
Everyone runs outside.

00:39:47.052 --> 00:39:49.684
Bill carries Kelly outside.

00:39:49.744 --> 00:39:51.075
Is everyone here?

00:39:51.135 --> 00:39:52.136
Asks Nick.

00:39:52.196 --> 00:39:53.456
He counts.

00:39:53.516 --> 00:39:55.644
There are 20 people.

00:39:55.705 --> 00:40:01.475
The fire destroys the house and the evil ghosts inside.

00:40:01.535 --> 00:40:04.557
Terrible noises come from the house.

00:40:04.617 --> 00:40:08.190
This is the scariest Halloween party of my life.

00:40:08.250 --> 00:40:10.040
