00:40:25.804 --> 00:40:28.047
Oh, Kelly, please wake up.

00:40:28.107 --> 00:40:29.368
Says Megan.

00:40:29.428 --> 00:40:32.208
Suddenly, it starts raining.

00:40:32.268 --> 00:40:34.699
There is thunder and lightning.

00:40:34.759 --> 00:40:36.879
Kelly moves her head.

00:40:36.939 --> 00:40:38.270
Where am I?

00:40:38.330 --> 00:40:39.460
