00:40:39.520 --> 00:40:41.680
Oh, Kelly, you're okay.

00:40:41.740 --> 00:40:43.281
I'm so happy.

00:40:43.341 --> 00:40:44.421
Says Megan.

00:40:44.481 --> 00:40:46.261
What's happening?

00:40:46.321 --> 00:40:48.042
Asks Kelly.

00:40:48.102 --> 00:40:51.982
Bill smiles and explains everything to her.

00:40:52.042 --> 00:40:54.343
Do you believe in ghosts now?

00:40:54.403 --> 00:40:55.800
Asks Nick.

00:40:55.860 --> 00:41:06.081
Bill looks at him and slowly says, well, yes.

00:41:06.141 --> 00:41:11.234
Then they all go home.

00:41:11.294 --> 00:41:15.425
Kelly has some strange dreams that night.

00:41:15.485 --> 00:41:18.356
